### Task Completed: `t_5d9f6062` — Design Research: Kids-Friendly UI References for Sketchbook Universe

The design research and UI redesign blueprint has been completed, verified, and documented.

---

### Key Deliverables & Summary

1. **Master Design Research Document:**
   - [`DESIGN_RESEARCH.md`](file:///srv/sketchbook/Sketchbook-Universe-v2/DESIGN_RESEARCH.md)

2. **Artistic Core Concept & Audience Tuning:**
   - **Target Audience:** SMP Students (Grades 7–9, Ages 12–15).
   - **Visual Identity:** *"The Junior Illustrator's Physical Field Desk & Living Sketchbook"* — inspired by indie creative maker games (*Nintendo Labo, Scribblenauts, Chicory: A Colorful Tale*). Strictly avoids toddler/kindergarten tropes while rejecting generic corporate SaaS aesthetics.

3. **Verified Real-World Benchmark References (7 Live Citations):**
   - [**i-Spy** (Awwwards SOTD)](https://www.awwwards.com/sites/i-spy): Bold, tactile hand-drawn line weights and organic framing.
   - [**World Draw** (Awwwards SOTD)](https://www.awwwards.com/sites/world-draw): Seamless doodle-to-world manifestation mechanics.
   - [**Quick, Draw!** (Google Creative Lab)](https://quickdraw.withgoogle.com): Instantaneous AI stroke feedback and honest machine guessing cues.
   - [**Exploring Prespa** (Awwwards SOTD)](https://www.awwwards.com/sites/exploring-prespa): Educational chapter dossiers and tactile mission tags.
   - [**Draw a Stickman** (Webby Winner)](https://www.awwwards.com/sites/draw-a-stickman): Consequential play and character reactions.
   - [**Paper Planes** (Awwwards SOTD)](https://www.awwwards.com/sites/paper-planes): Physical papercraft materiality and tactile stamps.
   - [**My Little Storybook** (Awwwards SOTD)](https://www.awwwards.com/sites/my-little-storybook): Manga/storybook editorial layouts and expressive comic speech balloons.

4. **Surface Archetypes Defined for Core Screens:**
   - **Level Entry Screen:** *The Illustrator's Field Desk & Chapter Dossier* (Notebook tabs, stage stamps, asymmetric mission logbook).
   - **Drawing Screen:** *The Studio Easel & Drafting Table* (Cartridge paper canvas, optical camera PIP lens, gesture HUD, instrument rack).
   - **Evaluation & Decision Screen:** *The AI Analysis Desk & Inspector's Clipboard* (Comparative sketch freeze-frame vs. Top-3 diagnostic barometer, tactile decision stamps).
   - **Gameplay Consequence Screen:** *The Living Sketchbook Theater & Consequence Portal* (Framed cutout stage, dynamic comic outcome postcard, clear retry/revise recovery).

5. **Anti-Slop Audit (10-Tell Rubric):**
   - **Score: 0/10 Slop.**
   - Feature-tile grids, center stacks, and wrong surface metaphors are eliminated.
   - Replaces generic AI gradients with deep charcoal drafting ink (`#162032`), warm cartridge paper (`#FAF6EE`), studio cobalt (`#2563EB`), amber ochre (`#D97706`), and forest mint (`#059669`).
   - Strict WCAG AA contrast (12.8:1 text contrast), >= 44px touch targets, fluid 390px mobile responsiveness, and `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`.

